&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/4ba629fd482a4c18b76854946594f91a/reader/22" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十九章&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>卡妈百合同人文（调教，高h，大概）</title><link>https://aiacg.github.io/novels/2026/07/14/ogoo8k8oc48w8sgo/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 16:03:11 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://aiacg.github.io/novels/2026/07/14/ogoo8k8oc48w8sgo/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="本页为收录内容-点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情"&gt;本页为收录内容 点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9" style="color: #fff; background: #e74c3c; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); display: inline-block;"&gt;前往查看详情&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第一章抓住星星&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二章命令，露天玩乳房，在强制睡眠中高潮了～&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三章微h 算是过度章，被卡妈关小屋里去&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四章h穴夹锁链，卡妈还坏坏得把你夹着的锁链扯来扯去的，后面还被控制着舔卡妈小穴&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第五章h被控制着，锁链突然变冷，但依旧磨着你的穴后又被塞进你的小穴里去成功被破处（主要就是被控制啦被锁链干了嘛））&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第六章h被塞入锁链还不够，卡妈决定让你好好看看你自己是怎么被一条锁链干到高潮的，但你话太多所以给你上了口球。之后给你被玩具磨穴的奖励，玩具进去了但是又没有完全进去&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第七章h强高禁高+玩具入xue（但没完全入）+玩具震阴蒂+放置play&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第八章微h 一醒来就犯了胃病，卡妈看了决定用手帮你缓解一下，为了安抚你卡妈甚至决定闻着你的花穴的香味和你一起休息一下，然后给你穿上铁链衣拉着你吃饭去。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/9" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第九章h 卡妈把你捆好后带你进客厅吃饭啦，这路途可谓是十分得艰难啊，高潮了多少次都记不太清了，含着铁链走到客厅的感觉也不知道怎么样，反正大概是爽的吧&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/10" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十章h 被卡妈抓着坐在卡妈腿上，上面被喂，下面也在被喂&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/11" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十一章h 餐桌上一边被卡妈喂吃的一边被卡妈的手玩到高潮～～连饭都不让你好好吃呢。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/12" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十二章h 卡妈打算给你上个药，但发现涂的地方不太多，于是亲自给你多加点伤，顺便再让你的潜意识接受调教，让你以后下意识地不敢拒绝卡妈，嘿嘿～&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/13" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十三章h 卡妈终于认真给你上药了，结果你的身体又高潮了，整得之前涂的药白费了，只能重新再上一遍……&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/14" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十四章 本章剧情章 醒来后去洗漱间洗漱，结果刚起来就因为腿软重新摔回床上，“正巧”被摄像头另一边的卡妈看个正着…&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/15" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十五章 这个也是过渡章 卡妈下达了命令，那么，你该不该听从呢？&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/16" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十六章 半h（应该是的） 这章就是新一轮do的开端了，吃完饭的你在喝不知道可能加了什么的牛奶和项圈中毅然决然选择了后者，但来自卡妈的关爱永远不会少滴～～&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/17" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十七章 被算计后（h和剧情为7：3）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/18" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十八章浴室中，药与水的折磨（又名安全意识第一，科技防范赛高！）（h）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/19" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十九章 门之隔，来自卡妈的命令——自慰（h）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/20" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十章（h）隔着门的，命令游戏。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/21" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十一章（h）隔着门的，命令游戏（二）像个乖狗一样，被卡妈的语言摆布着。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/22" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十二章（h）游戏结束？怎么可能。被卡妈艹后小穴被卡妈的手套塞得满满当当～～&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/23" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十三章（h）连个手套都夹不住吗？那就帮帮你好了（黑丝jio+手套+小玩具））&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/24" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十四章带到小黑屋去哩！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/25" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十五停下？好啊，那就自己来吧。（h）蹭蹭膝盖，一直蹭一直爽嘿嘿&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/26" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十六章（h）小穴和口腔的双重侵犯。还有力气逃？那就再加一根！嘿嘿~&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/27" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十七章剧情章。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/28" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十八章（h）一回来就发现沙发上熟睡的小可爱，这种时候怎么做？当然是肆意妄为！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/29" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二十九章咬人的小猫，得罚。（h）关小白屋！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/30" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十章（h）爱咬人，那就乖乖做只小狗好了&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/31" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十一章（h）渴望亲吻的小狗……乖，会给你的。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/32" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十二章（h）一边幻想着在办公室里被c，一样又像小狗一样求着c，唔，再来几次应该能构成条件反射了。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/33" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十三章（h）“梦”与现实交织的双重c，被压在玻璃上c，现实却是被吊起来用小皮鞭打嘿嘿。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/34" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十四章（h）这次只有现实part，用了个点痛笔&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/35" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三十五章（h）用点痛笔开启了新领域——后穴。顺带再来个卡妈的自慰回。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/36" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四十章小奶牛什么的，肯定会产奶的啦&lt;del&gt;聪明的你们肯定猜得出来下一章的内容的。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/37" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四十一章可以产奶的小奶牛要求着卡妈帮忙呀&lt;/del&gt;合格的小奶牛也要会自己喂卡妈喝牛奶哟，不过还是太笨，只能先惩罚一下啦。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/38" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四十三章大概就是卡妈坏坏的撩了做了但又不全做完所以勇敢a（送自己）上去后被卡妈爆炒晕了。&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/eed3c0d3a2834f4baa7b2e42d2dd75e9/reader/39" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;除夕快乐，除夕番外来啦！！&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>我的妈妈卡芙卡在我故意放手下成为了宿敌同学的肉便器</title><link>https://aiacg.github.io/novels/2026/06/05/kog00wkc4s84804r/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 07:37:04 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://aiacg.github.io/novels/2026/06/05/kog00wkc4s84804r/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="本页为收录内容-点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情"&gt;本页为收录内容 点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情&lt;/h2&gt;
