&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2dacc0ba05844301b6c50f1ec3a366e0/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;#5 【05】我当面否认：用“玩笑”将卡芙卡妈妈送入肉便器的深渊&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2dacc0ba05844301b6c50f1ec3a366e0/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;#6 【06】卡芙卡妈妈，在我的放手下被戒指契约洗脑成同学的便器妻子（上）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2dacc0ba05844301b6c50f1ec3a366e0/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;#7 【07】卡芙卡妈妈，在我的放手下被戒指契约洗脑成同学的便器妻子（下）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2dacc0ba05844301b6c50f1ec3a366e0/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;#8 【08】卡芙卡的街头露出，被混混轮奸拍下视频带回家，最终成为了我的撸管配菜&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2dacc0ba05844301b6c50f1ec3a366e0/reader/9" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;#9 【09】被卖到妓院当作嫖资的卡芙卡其实只是为了完成主人的任务罢了&lt;/a&gt;
